{"id":"9e9de77b0e35d3716fa520c44d92a1c11405e0ed","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"9e9de77b0e35d3716fa520c44d92a1c11405e0ed","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/store-prune-sweeps-after-last-project.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm store prune` now removes global virtual store packages after every project that used them is deleted. An install that uses the global virtual store now fails if it cannot register the project in the store."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/store/in_use_files.rs","lines":["@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ use pnpm_config::{"," };"," use pnpm_deps_restorer::{","     binary_store_index_key,","+    read_pnp_package_dirs,","     store_index_key_for_resolution,"," };"," use pnpm_env_replace::env_replace_lossy;","@@ -57,6 +58,8 @@ use std::{"," ///   of every side-effects entry;"," /// - the modules directory of every project it lists."," ///","+/// And the package directories of each registered project's `.pnp.cjs`.","+///"," /// Every file of the rows of the archives each registered project's"," /// `pylock.toml` pins."," ///","@@ -67,9 +70,15 @@ use std::{"," pub(super) fn in_use(store_dir: &StoreDir) -> Result<InUse, PruneError> {","     let mut keys = HashSet::new();","     let mut modules_dirs = ModulesDirs::default();","+    let mut package_dirs = Vec::new();","     for project in get_registered_projects(store_dir).map_err(PruneError::ListProjects)? {","         // The registry joins a relative link target without normalizing it.","         let project = lexical_normalize(&project);","+        package_dirs.extend(","+            read_pnp_package_dirs(&project)","+                .map_err(io::Error::other)","+                .map_err(PruneError::InUseFiles)?,","+        );","         let modules_dir = modules_dirs.add(&project).map_err(PruneError::InUseFiles)?;","         keys.extend(python_index_keys(&project).map_err(PruneError::InUseFiles)?);"," 